  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable found that when two people’s lucks are joined, the one with greater luck gains more benefit and the one with weaker luck suffers more hardship. He named this relationship the main luck and the sub luck, and created a luck path Immortal Gu for each. While Fang Yuan is using the killer move fixed luck, he has no main luck Immortal Gu, but by fixing his own luck and setting it apart from others’, he can still become the main luck.",
